{"id":"61","title":"Home Improvements","goal":"Report progress on a home project and ask a professional about the scope, cost and timing of work.","language":"en","study":[{"id":"61-study-0","title":"Start here","blocks":[{"id":"ch61-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Home improvements","emphasis":true},{"text":" are changes intended to improve a home. "},{"text":"DIY","emphasis":true},{"text":", short for "},{"text":"do-it-yourself","emphasis":true},{"text":", describes doing the work yourself. You can discuss a project without knowing how to perform every part of it."}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":["ch61-p144796530899975","ch61-p259060488059659","ch61-p161661147566028"]},{"id":"ch61-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Useful project words include "},{"text":"paint the walls","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"put up shelves","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"remove wallpaper","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"hang wallpaper","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"install carpet","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"repair a fence","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"assemble a bookcase","emphasis":true},{"text":". "},{"text":"Assemble","emphasis":true},{"text":" means put parts together. A "},{"text":"coat of paint","emphasis":true},{"text":" is one layer. "},{"text":"Tiles","emphasis":true},{"text":" are pieces used to cover a surface; "},{"text":"grout","emphasis":true},{"text":" is material that fills spaces between tiles. These terms describe work rather than give instructions for doing it."}],"span":[8,8],"phraseIds":["ch61-p18408988240681","ch61-p172975942131095","ch61-p227579458866135","ch61-p261050850991951","ch61-p50879240547657","ch61-p30828825301868","ch61-p58626251859521","ch61-p152427426887340","ch61-p24840972190497","ch61-p85575871008784","ch61-p175366271755866"]}],"line":6,"ja":"","theme":"renovation"},{"id":"61-study-1","title":"Explain what is finished","blocks":[{"id":"ch61-b2","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"A","runs":[{"text":"How's the kitchen project going?"}],"id":"ch61-line12","person":"A","en":"How's the kitchen project going?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122313.svg"},{"speaker":"B","runs":[{"text":"We've finished removing the wallpaper. The walls still need painting."}],"id":"ch61-line13","person":"B","en":"We've finished removing the wallpaper. The walls still need painting.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122314.svg"},{"speaker":"A","runs":[{"text":"Are you painting them yourselves?"}],"id":"ch61-line14","person":"A","en":"Are you painting them yourselves?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122313.svg"},{"speaker":"B","runs":[{"text":"We haven't decided. We're asking someone for a quote first."}],"id":"ch61-line15","person":"B","en":"We haven't decided. We're asking someone for a quote first.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122314.svg"},{"speaker":"A","runs":[{"text":"What about the shelves?"}],"id":"ch61-line16","person":"A","en":"What about the shelves?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122313.svg"},{"speaker":"B","runs":[{"text":"They're not up yet. That's the next job."}],"id":"ch61-line17","person":"B","en":"They're not up yet. That's the next job.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8122314.svg"}],"span":[12,17],"art":"ch61-scene-0.svg","theme":"renovation","people":["A","B"],"caption":"Explain what is finished · A & B","phraseIds":["ch61-line12","ch61-line13","ch61-line14","ch61-line15","ch61-line16","ch61-line17"]},{"id":"ch61-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"We've finished...","emphasis":true},{"text":" identifies completed work. "},{"text":"We still need to...","emphasis":true},{"text":" identifies remaining work. "},{"text":"Not yet","emphasis":true},{"text":" means something has not happened up to now; it does not necessarily mean the project has been abandoned. For a small update: "},{"text":"The tiles are in place, but the grouting isn't finished","emphasis":true},{"text":" or "},{"text":"There's one more coat of paint to go","emphasis":true},{"text":"."}],"span":[19,19],"phraseIds":["ch61-p153213614179451","ch61-p56290382531228","ch61-p117423427060774","ch61-p62121221802508","ch61-p169305182055667"]},{"id":"ch61-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"How's it going?","emphasis":true},{"text":" here asks about a particular project. Give useful detail rather than treating it only as a greeting. A positive comment is "},{"text":"It's looking good","emphasis":true},{"text":"; a concern is "},{"text":"I'm happy with the color, but that corner still needs attention","emphasis":true},{"text":"."}],"span":[21,21],"phraseIds":["ch61-p116022259360948","ch61-p24266211332243","ch61-p28037767523736"]}],"line":10,"ja":"","theme":"renovation"},{"id":"61-study-2","title":"Request a quote","blocks":[{"id":"ch61-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A "},{"text":"quote","emphasis":true},{"text":" states a proposed price for described work. Ask what it covers. "},{"text":"Materials","emphasis":true},{"text":" are the items used for the work; "},{"text":"labor","emphasis":true},{"text":" is the work people perform. "},{"text":"Supply the materials","emphasis":true},{"text":" means provide them."}],"span":[25,25],"phraseIds":["ch61-p167903667488589","ch61-p278982146410554","ch61-p133327652207524","ch61-p272316139204435"]},{"id":"ch61-b6","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Caller","runs":[{"text":"Hi. We need someone to paint our kitchen walls. Could you give us a quote?"}],"id":"ch61-line27","person":"Caller","en":"Hi. We need someone to paint our kitchen walls. Could you give us a quote?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3928617586.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"Yes. I'd need to see the room and discuss what you want done."}],"id":"ch61-line28","person":"Professional","en":"Yes. I'd need to see the room and discuss what you want done.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"},{"speaker":"Caller","runs":[{"text":"Could you come on Thursday afternoon?"}],"id":"ch61-line29","person":"Caller","en":"Could you come on Thursday afternoon?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3928617586.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"I have two thirty available."}],"id":"ch61-line30","person":"Professional","en":"I have two thirty available.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"},{"speaker":"Caller","runs":[{"text":"That works. We'd also like to discuss putting up two shelves."}],"id":"ch61-line31","person":"Caller","en":"That works. We'd also like to discuss putting up two shelves.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3928617586.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"Okay. I'll look at both jobs during the visit."}],"id":"ch61-line32","person":"Professional","en":"Okay. I'll look at both jobs during the visit.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"}],"span":[27,32],"art":"ch61-scene-1.svg","theme":"renovation","people":["Caller","Professional"],"caption":"Request a quote · Caller & Professional","phraseIds":["ch61-line27","ch61-line28","ch61-line29","ch61-line30","ch61-line31","ch61-line32"]},{"id":"ch61-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"For a different task: "},{"text":"Could you quote for repairing this fence?","emphasis":true},{"text":" or "},{"text":"We'd like someone to assemble this bookcase","emphasis":true},{"text":". Explain the result you want; ask about anything you cannot describe precisely."}],"span":[34,34],"phraseIds":["ch61-p230881000710502","ch61-p253221628372467"]}],"line":23,"ja":"","theme":"renovation"},{"id":"61-study-3","title":"Clarify before deciding","blocks":[{"id":"ch61-b8","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"For the following fictional quote, painting the kitchen walls costs $240 and includes paint and labor. Painting the ceiling and installing shelves are separate jobs. The professional offers a Monday morning start and expects the wall work to take one day."}],"span":[38,38],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ch61-b9","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Does the two-hundred-forty-dollar quote include the paint?"}],"id":"ch61-line40","person":"Customer","en":"Does the two-hundred-forty-dollar quote include the paint?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"Yes, paint and labor for the walls. The ceiling isn't included."}],"id":"ch61-line41","person":"Professional","en":"Yes, paint and labor for the walls. The ceiling isn't included.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"And the shelves would be a separate quote?"}],"id":"ch61-line42","person":"Customer","en":"And the shelves would be a separate quote?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"That's right."}],"id":"ch61-line43","person":"Professional","en":"That's right.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"When could you start the wall work?"}],"id":"ch61-line44","person":"Customer","en":"When could you start the wall work?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"Monday morning. I expect it to take one day."}],"id":"ch61-line45","person":"Professional","en":"Monday morning. I expect it to take one day.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Could you send the scope and price in writing? We'd like to review them before deciding."}],"id":"ch61-line46","person":"Customer","en":"Could you send the scope and price in writing? We'd like to review them before deciding.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Professional","runs":[{"text":"Sure."}],"id":"ch61-line47","person":"Professional","en":"Sure.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-3280543694.svg"}],"span":[40,47],"art":"ch61-scene-2.svg","theme":"renovation","people":["Customer","Professional"],"caption":"Clarify before deciding · Customer & Professional","phraseIds":["ch61-line40","ch61-line41","ch61-line42","ch61-line43","ch61-line44","ch61-line45","ch61-line46","ch61-line47"]},{"id":"ch61-b10","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"An expected duration is an estimate, not a promise that every project will take that long. "},{"text":"That's above our budget","emphasis":true},{"text":" explains a limit. "},{"text":"Is there a less expensive option?","emphasis":true},{"text":" asks about changing the proposal. "},{"text":"We'd like to go ahead with the wall work","emphasis":true},{"text":" accepts that work; it does not automatically accept every separately discussed job."}],"span":[49,49],"phraseIds":["ch61-p246343002881568","ch61-p264718103125461","ch61-p198659804451103"]}],"line":36,"ja":"","theme":"renovation"},{"id":"61-words","title":"Words & phrases","blocks":[{"id":"61-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch61-v0","ch61-v1","ch61-v2","ch61-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"61-practice-0","title":"Take your turn","blocks":[{"id":"ch61-b11","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Speak both roles alone. For a partner version, one person reads the project or quote facts while the other asks questions."}],"span":[53,53]},{"id":"ch61-b12","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"A project has finished wallpaper removal. Painting and shelves remain. Answer "},{"text":"How's the project going?","emphasis":true},{"text":" with completed and remaining work."}],"id":"ch61-b12-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"Request a visit for painting and two shelves. Arrange Thursday at two thirty using the model's available time."}],"id":"ch61-b12-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"Use the $240 quote to ask whether paint, the ceiling and shelves are included. Give complete replies from the stated facts."}],"id":"ch61-b12-2"},{"number":4,"runs":[{"text":"Your budget is $200. Explain the difference and ask about an alternative without claiming a new price has been agreed."}],"id":"ch61-b12-3"}],"span":[55,58]}],"line":53,"ja":"","theme":"renovation","answers":[{"id":"ch61-b13","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"Sample possibilities:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “We've removed the wallpaper, but we still need to paint the walls and put up the shelves.” / “Could you come Thursday at two thirty?” / “Paint is included, but the ceiling and shelves are separate.” / “That's above our two-hundred-dollar budget. Is there a less expensive option?”"}],"span":[60,60]},{"id":"ch61-b14","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Later, cover the models and report a different project: a bookcase is assembled, but the shelves are not up. Check whether you separated completed work, proposed work and work you actually agreed to."}],"span":[62,62]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch61-p144796530899975","en":"Home improvements","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p144796530899975"},{"id":"ch61-p259060488059659","en":"DIY","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p259060488059659"},{"id":"ch61-p161661147566028","en":"do-it-yourself","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p161661147566028"},{"art":"word-paint.svg","id":"ch61-p18408988240681","en":"paint the walls","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch61-p18408988240681"},{"id":"ch61-p172975942131095","en":"put up shelves","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch61-p172975942131095"},{"id":"ch61-p227579458866135","en":"remove wallpaper","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p227579458866135"},{"id":"ch61-p261050850991951","en":"hang wallpaper","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p261050850991951"},{"id":"ch61-p50879240547657","en":"install carpet","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch61-p50879240547657"},{"id":"ch61-p30828825301868","en":"repair a fence","section":"61-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch61-p30828825301868"},{"id":"ch61-